12
00:00:39,148 --> 00:00:42,278
Like nines or 10s.

13
00:00:42,751 --> 00:00:44,121
Nines or 10s?

14
00:00:44,286 --> 00:00:48,586
(Raj:)Okay, an eight is acceptable if she's willing
